/** @defgroup bflat_ts_optimizer bflat build - Optimizer and register allocation
 * @ingroup bflat_ts
 * @{
 *
 * @brief Tests of the decisions the compiler makes without changing what a method computes.
 *
 *        The choice of registers, spills and reloads, switch tables, inlining,
 *        block weights, null checks, and the code generation switches of the
 *        zkVM builds.
 *
 *        A program prints "ALL PASS" and returns zero, or prints every
 *        failed check and returns non-zero. Where the compiler has a switch
 *        for what a program tests, a second run builds the same program with
 *        the switch the other way.
 *
 * @}
